{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-logistics","title":"现代物流管理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":7,"docCount":24,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"现代物流管理-简介\">现代物流管理 简介</h1><p>现代物流管理是职业本科教育中面向数字化供应链时代的核心管理学科，对接物流服务师、供应链管理师、数字化管理师等新兴职业标准，培养精通智慧仓储、运输调度、供应链协同与物流数据分析的高端技术技能人才。教育部2025年发布的《现代物流管理专业教学标准（高等职业教育本科）》明确了本专业面向物流数据应用、物流系统分析、物流项目管理三大核心能力的培养要求。</p>\n<p>本专业课程体系围绕&quot;技术赋能+管理创新&quot;双核展开，学生既需掌握物流运筹学、系统建模、数据分析等量化方法，又需具备仓储规划、运输优化、采购管理等实操技能，最终形成覆盖物流全链条的数字化管理能力。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>物流基础与系统</strong>建立物流学科的理论根基，涵盖物流基本理论与运营管理、运输方式与线路优化、物流系统分析与建模三大模块，使学生掌握物流活动的基本规律与系统化思维方式。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>智慧仓储与配送</strong>聚焦物流执行环节的智能化升级，深入讲解智能仓储系统（AGV/立体仓库）、自动分拣与末端配送、冷链与特种物流三个领域，培养学生运用智能装备提升物流效率的实践能力。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>供应链管理</strong>从全局视角构建供应链协同能力，涵盖供应链战略与网络设计、采购与库存优化、国际物流与跨境贸易三个维度，使学生具备从局部物流到全链条优化的战略思维。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>物流数字化创新</strong>面向行业最新发展趋势，通过物流大数据分析、物流平台技术架构、低空物流与创新模式三个方向，培养学生引领物流行业数字化变革的前瞻能力。</p>\n<p>建议学习路径：先通过第一章掌握物流基础理论和系统思维，再在第二章学习仓储配送的智能化实操，然后在第三章将视野拓展到供应链全局，最终在第四章中掌握行业前沿的数字化创新方向。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logistics-foundations","title":"物流管理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/logistics-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logistics-principles","title":"现代物流学原理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/logistics-foundations/logistics-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"logistics-economics-law","title":"物流经济学与法规","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/logistics-foundations/logistics-economics-law"},{"seq":3,"slug":"operations-research-optimization","title":"运筹学与物流优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/logistics-foundations/operations-research-optimization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"logistics-fundamentals-systems","title":"物流基础与系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/logistics-fundamentals-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logistics-theory-operations","title":"物流理论与运营管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/logistics-fundamentals-systems/logistics-theory-operations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transportation-management","title":"运输管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/logistics-fundamentals-systems/transportation-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"logistics-system-analysis","title":"物流系统分析与建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/logistics-fundamentals-systems/logistics-system-analysis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-warehousing-distribution","title":"智慧仓储与配送","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/smart-warehousing-distribution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intelligent-warehouse-systems","title":"智能仓储系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/smart-warehousing-distribution/intelligent-warehouse-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"automated-sorting-distribution","title":"自动分拣与配送","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/smart-warehousing-distribution/automated-sorting-distribution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cold-chain-special-logistics","title":"冷链与特种物流","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/smart-warehousing-distribution/cold-chain-special-logistics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"smart-warehousing-transport","title":"智慧仓储与运输","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/smart-warehousing-transport","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"smart-warehousing-systems","title":"智慧仓储系统与设备","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/smart-warehousing-transport/smart-warehousing-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transport-route-optimization","title":"运输管理与路径优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/smart-warehousing-transport/t